1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,440
W: Jonathan, if you have not reserved your flight tickets yet, you'd better do it soon.

2
00:00:04,760 --> 00:00:09,140
I was just told by Sarah that it was going to be difficult to get seats from next week.

3
00:00:09,660 --> 00:00:09,840
M: Oh?

4
00:00:10,180 --> 00:00:10,760
Why is that?

5
00:00:11,230 --> 00:00:16,300
W: Well, the International Film Festival is being held in New York during the same week as our conference.

6
00:00:17,280 --> 00:00:24,340
This event apparently attracts thousands of people from all walks of life into the city, and all the flights and hotel rooms get booked.

7
00:00:24,700 --> 00:00:25,450
M: Is that right?

8
00:00:25,815 --> 00:00:28,560
In that case, I'd better call right now and book a seat.

9
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:30,400
I don't want to miss the conference.
